# The six composited hero layers are INTERMEDIATES, not deliverables: pure output of
# `apps/website/scripts/regenerate-hero.sh` from `brand/screenshots/`, ~2 MB a set, and
# binaries git can't delta. Committing them meant every reshoot added that much pack
# forever. The shipped WebPs in `apps/website/public/hero/` are tracked; these are not.
#
# This file is tracked so the directory exists in a fresh clone and the docs that point
# here resolve.
*.png
!.gitignore
